  sectionDataList:
  - sectionId: 77ec180c-873a-11f0-a640-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: Choose ink
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: Expalin Ink and feature
    characterId: ea7d4c5e-8732-11f0-8135-42010a7be01f
  - sectionId: 0f6fccd6-873c-11f0-802f-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: choose Desing
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: Expalin desing and feature
    characterId: ea7d4c5e-8732-11f0-8135-42010a7be01f
  - sectionId: 385032fc-8738-11f0-baa0-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: process_complete
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: thanks for completing the process
    characterId: ea7d4c5e-8732-11f0-8135-42010a7be01f
  - sectionId: 1f35e9e2-8738-11f0-a70c-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: Screen printing process
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: Expalin Screen printing process in screen printing octopus and importance
    characterId: ea7d4c5e-8732-11f0-8135-42010a7be01f
  - sectionId: 29bedf0e-8738-11f0-a70c-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: ink error
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: Explain the error in choosing the compatible ink, and which ink would
      be compatible with the printing surface you chose before.
    characterId: ea7d4c5e-8732-11f0-8135-42010a7be01f
  - sectionId: 1325297e-8738-11f0-b1a1-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: Missing Printing Surface
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: First, select a printing surface. Depending on the type of surface
      you'll be printing on, you'll need to select the ink. A brief explanation of
      printing surfaces and their characteristics is provided.
    characterId: ea7d4c5e-8732-11f0-8135-42010a7be01f
  - sectionId: c6c1009c-8734-11f0-baa0-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: Material Seleccion
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: Explains the types of materials, printing surfaces, design and frames,
      as well as the order in which to choose them,
    characterId: ea7d4c5e-8732-11f0-8135-42010a7be01f
  - sectionId: 4237e638-8734-11f0-802f-42010a7be01f
    sectionName: 'Welcome '
    behaviorTreeConstants: 
    objective: "Welcome to screen printing hall i am Manue, yous \nvirtual guide.\n\nExplain
      the screen printing room, the virtual space, and ask if you want to ready for
      start the screen printing process."
    characterId: ea7d4c5e-8732-11f0-8135-42010a7be01f
